<title>UK: Fannie Mae prices $1.0 bln five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Fannie Mae prices $1.0 bln five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced earlier by joint lead managers Lehman Brothers and Merrill Lynch, has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FEDERAL NATIONAL MORTGAGE ASSOCIATION (FANNIE MAE)</p>
<p> AMT    $1.0 BLN	COUPON     6.375     MATURITY    16.JAN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.863    PAY DATE    24.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  25 BP     REOFFER    99.863    SPREAD	+10 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    =	   PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) =	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    =	   CRS DEFLT  =	   FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    =	   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  15 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND FIVE-YEAR U.S. TREASURY BOND</p>
